{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人陳豪日前突擊到自家精品咖啡店巡視，還帶菠蘿包「萬歲」。事後他在社交網分享短片，笑言是「突擊檢查」，又親手炮製招牌棉花糖拿鐵，由打奶泡、拉花、擠棉花糖忌廉，再用火槍炙燒表面，手勢熟練又專業，他笑說：「身為稱職嘅老闆，應該忙完宣傳之後去突擊檢查，再順便請大家食下午茶……我絕對唔係為咗飲咖啡嘅。」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.478342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:57:36.821413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:42.922491+00:00","content_hash":"a67564310092130101602dd610eef57ad99f67f87c9b97bb4b0e2e370e863a6f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.478342+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}